AUDIO: '15-second high-end fragrance campaign with the bottle\'s shape, colors, logo, and packaging preserved exactly. The agent researches the perfume, writes the numbered shot list, waits for your'

[06:33] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'approval, and then the render follows those beats in order, petals and particles suspended in the air. a dive straight through the bottle\'s own reflections, landing on a clean, centered hero shot with the branding untouched. That approval step is'

[06:46] [scene:talk]
