AUDIO: 'creators shot for three different brands. There\'s a Polo tryon in there, a [music] PlayStation 5 unboxing skit with two guys in a gaming room, and a watch spot where a silver-haired man crosses a hotel lobby while the camera keeps'

[10:35] [scene:talk]
